  "content": "<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4f1e404d wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Listen to this post:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-passport-podcast-player\">\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-passport-podcast-player-logged-out-view\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Good morning,</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This week&#8217;s Stratechery Interview is with Roblox CEO <a href=\"https://x.com/DavidBaszucki\">David Baszucki</a>. I&#8217;ve interviewed Baszucki twice, in <a href=\"https://stratechery.com/2022/roblox-earnings-an-interview-with-roblox-ceo-david-baszucki\">February 2022</a>, and <a href=\"https://stratechery.com/2023/an-interview-with-roblox-ceo-david-baszucki-about-advertising-and-ai\">November 2023</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What struck me about this interview is just how much AI has changed the landscape for Roblox. This was a company predicated on the concept that anyone can make a game, but now, for the first time, literally anyone can make a game. That means a world of abundance, and in that world, there is an opportunity to be an Aggregator, and Roblox is aggressively pursuing that opportunity.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To that end, we discuss how AI has ch",
